{"id":"scotch-game","name":"Scotch Game","side":"white","blurb":"White opens the centre on move three with d4. Clear, active play that avoids the long theory of the Ruy Lopez and is popular at every level.","setup":["e4","e5","Nf3","Nc6","d4"],"lineCount":15,"puzzleCount":80,"lines":[{"id":"l01","name":"Mieses Variation","moves":["e4","e5","Nf3","Nc6","d4","exd4","Nxd4","Nf6","Nxc6","bxc6","e5","Qe7","Qe2","Nd5","c4"]},{"id":"l02","name":"Paulsen, Gunsberg Defense","moves":["e4","e5","Nf3","Nc6","d4","exd4","Nxd4","Bc5","Be3","Qf6","c3","Nge7","Bb5","Nd8","O-O"]},{"id":"l03","name":"Mieses Variation","moves":["e4","e5","Nf3","Nc6","d4","exd4","Nxd4","Nf6","Nxc6","bxc6","e5","Nd5","c4","Nb6","Bd3"]},{"id":"l04","name":"Lolli Variation","moves":["e4","e5","Nf3","Nc6","d4","Nxd4","Nxd4","exd4","Qxd4","Qf6","Qc4","c6","Nc3","b5","Qd3"]},{"id":"l05","name":"Scotch Game","moves":["e4","e5","Nf3","Nc6","d4","d6","d5","Nb8","Nc3","Be7","h3","Nf6","Be3","Nbd7","Nd2"]},{"id":"l06","name":"Classical Variation","moves":["e4","e5","Nf3","Nc6","d4","exd4","Nxd4","Bc5","Be3","Bb6","Nf5","d5","Nxg7+","Kf8","Nh5"]},{"id":"l07","name":"Classical Variation, Millennium Variation","moves":["e4","e5","Nf3","Nc6","d4","exd4","Nxd4","Bc5","Be3","Qf6","c3","Qg6","Qd3","Nge7","Nb5"]},{"id":"l08","name":"Scotch Game","moves":["e4","e5","Nf3","Nc6","d4","exd4","Nxd4","Qh4","Nb5","Bb4+","Bd2","Qxe4+","Be2","Kd8","O-O","Bxd2","Nxd2"]},{"id":"l09","name":"Classical Variation","moves":["e4","e5","Nf3","Nc6","d4","exd4","Nxd4","Bc5","Be3","Nf6","Nxc6","dxc6","Qxd8+","Kxd8","Bxc5"]},{"id":"l10","name":"Ghulam-Kassim Variation","moves":["e4","e5","Nf3","Nc6","d4","exd4","Nxd4","Nxd4","Qxd4","d6","Bd3","Nf6","Nc3","c6","Be2"]},{"id":"l11","name":"Malaniuk Variation","moves":["e4","e5","Nf3","Nc6","d4","exd4","Nxd4","Bb4+","c3","Bc5","Be2","Nf6","Nxc6","bxc6","e5"]},{"id":"l12","name":"Classical Variation","moves":["e4","e5","Nf3","Nc6","d4","exd4","Nxd4","Bc5","Be3","Nxd4","Bxd4","Bxd4","Qxd4","Qf6","e5"]},{"id":"l13","name":"Scotch Game","moves":["e4","e5","Nf3","Nc6","d4","exd4","Nxd4","Qf6","Nb3","Qg6","f3","Nf6","Nc3","Bb4","Bd2"]},{"id":"l14","name":"Scotch Game","moves":["e4","e5","Nf3","Nc6","d4","exd4","Nxd4","d6","Nc3","Nf6","Bf4","Be7","Qd2","Nxd4","Qxd4"]},{"id":"l15","name":"Scotch Game","moves":["e4","e5","Nf3","Nc6","d4","exd4","Nxd4","g6","Nc3","Bg7","Be3","d6","Qd2","Nf6","f3"]}],"ideas":{"e4":"Takes a central square and frees the queen and bishop.","e4 e5 Nf3":"Develops with an attack on e5.","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4":"The Scotch. White opens the centre at once, and e5 is now attacked twice.","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4":"Recaptures with the knight, which now stands on a strong central square.","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Bc5 Be3":"The bishop defends the d4 knight, which Black's c5 bishop is attacking.","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Bc5 Be3 Qf6 c3":"Adds a pawn defender to d4, which Black's queen, bishop and knight are all hitting.","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Nf6 Nxc6":"Trades knights so that after ...bxc6 White can push e5 and kick the f6 knight.","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Nf6 Nxc6 bxc6 e5":"Kicks the f6 knight and gains space.","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Nf6 Nxc6 bxc6 e5 Nd5 c4":"Kicks the knight again, this time from d5.","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Qh4 Nb5":"Against ...Qh4, the knight jumps to b5 and threatens Nxc7+, forking the king and the a8 rook.","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Bb4+ c3":"Blocks the check with a pawn that also attacks the bishop.","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 Nxd4 Nxd4 exd4 Qxd4":"Black's early ...Nxd4 just lets White's queen take back on a central square."},"names":{"e4":"King's Pawn Game","e4 e5":"King's Pawn Game","e4 e5 Nf3":"King's Knight Opening","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6":"King's Knight Opening: Normal Variation","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4":"Scotch Game","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4":"Scotch Game","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4":"Scotch Game","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Nf6":"Scotch Game: Schmidt Variation","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Nf6 Nxc6 bxc6 e5":"Scotch Game: Mieses Variation","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Bc5":"Scotch Game: Classical Variation","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Bc5 Be3 Qf6 c3 Nge7 Bb5":"Scotch Game: Paulsen Attack","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Bc5 Be3 Qf6 c3 Nge7 Bb5 Nd8":"Scotch Game: Paulsen, Gunsberg Defense","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 Nxd4":"Scotch Game: Lolli Variation","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 Nxd4 Nxd4 exd4 Qxd4":"Scotch Game: Lolli Variation","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Bc5 Be3 Qf6 c3 Qg6":"Scotch Game: Classical Variation, Millennium Variation","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Qh4":"Scotch Game: Steinitz Variation","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Qh4 Nb5":"Scotch Game: Horwitz Attack","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Qh4 Nb5 Bb4+ Bd2":"Scotch Game","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Nxd4 Qxd4 d6 Bd3":"Scotch Game: Ghulam-Kassim Variation","e4 e5 Nf3 Nc6 d4 exd4 Nxd4 Bb4+":"Scotch Game: Malaniuk Variation"}}